```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([User Visits Portal]) --> Login[Login /api/auth/login]
    Login --> AuthCheck{JWT Valid & Role Verified?}

    AuthCheck -- No --> ErrorState[HTTP 401 / Invalid Credentials]
    AuthCheck -- Yes --> RoleSwitch{Role Determination}

    %% Employee Pathway
    RoleSwitch -- "EMPLOYEE" --> EmpDash[Employee Dashboard]
    EmpDash --> EmpBalances[Leave Balances]
    EmpDash --> EmpApply[Apply Leave Form]
    EmpDash --> EmpHistory[My Leaves History]
    EmpDash --> EmpAvail[Team Availability Calendar]
    EmpDash --> EmpHolidays[Company Holidays]

    EmpApply --> SubmitLeave[Submit Request]
    SubmitLeave --> ConflictEngine{Conflict & Policy Check}
    ConflictEngine -- Pass --> PendingQueue[(Leave Stored as PENDING)]
    ConflictEngine -- Fail --> ShowValidationErr[Show Inline Policy/Balance Alert]

    %% Manager Pathway
    RoleSwitch -- "MANAGER" --> MgrDash[Manager Dashboard]
    MgrDash --> MgrTeam[Team Availability Matrix]
    MgrDash --> MgrApprovals[Pending Approvals Queue]
    MgrDash --> MgrSelfLeave[Apply Manager's Own Leave]
    
    MgrApprovals --> ReviewAction{Manager Decision}
    ReviewAction -- Approve --> ApprovedState[Status: APPROVED & Balance Deducted]
    ReviewAction -- Reject --> RejectedState[Status: REJECTED & Reason Captured]

    %% HR Admin Pathway
    RoleSwitch -- "HR_ADMIN" --> AdminDash[HR Admin Dashboard]
    AdminDash --> OrgEmployees[Employee Directory]
    AdminDash --> OrgDepartments[Department Management]
    AdminDash --> LeaveConfig[Leave Types & Policies]
    AdminDash --> BalManagement[Balance Reconciliations]
    AdminDash --> ManualAdjust[Credit/Debit Adjustments]
    AdminDash --> HolidayCalendar[Holiday Calendar Config]
    AdminDash --> AuditViewer[System Audit Trail]

    ApprovedState --> AuditLog[(Audit History Logged)]
    RejectedState --> AuditLog
    ManualAdjust --> AuditLog
```
